sequenceDiagram
	participant Browser as Customer Browser
	participant Gateway as API Gateway (YARP)
	participant Storefront as Storefront (Next.js 16)
	participant Commerce as Commerce (Next.js 16)

	Browser ->> Gateway: HTTPS GET /basket
	Gateway ->> Commerce: HTTP GET /basket
	Commerce -->> Browser: 307 Redirect /login?callbackUrl=/basket
	Browser ->> Gateway: HTTPS GET /login?callbackUrl=/basket
	Gateway ->> Storefront: HTTP GET /login?callbackUrl=/basket
	Storefront -->> Browser: Better Auth + Microsoft Entra ID sign-in
	Browser ->> Gateway: HTTPS GET /basket (with session cookie)
	Gateway ->> Commerce: HTTP GET /basket
	Commerce -->> Browser: 200 OK (X-Mfe-Zone: commerce)
